e company has moved 50 percent of its IT estate to Amazon Web Services, giving it the scale and security to run critical financial trading platforms as well as accelerating decarbonization and supporting its commitment to sustainability. By using the latest generative artificial intelligence solutions such as Amazon Bedrock, TP ICAP’s Parameta Solutions is transforming how its teams put new ideas into action.","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/tp-icap-logo%401x.e13716c27de215c38fc82082a98139a3b8d58a75.jpg","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/tp-icap-logo%401x.e13716c27de215c38fc82082a98139a3b8d58a75.jpg","displayLocation":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","customerNameLower":"tp icap","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2024-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/innovators/tp-icap/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"TP ICAP","publishedDate":"2024","enableShare":"1","headline":"TP ICAP on AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#financial-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Financial Services","description":"Financial Services","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Analytics","description":"Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","nam