 \u0026 Compliance","description":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:33+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#auto-scaling","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Auto Scaling","description":"AWS Auto Scaling","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#business-apps","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Business Applications","description":"Business Applications","dateCreated":"2020-08-20T04:22:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-24T02:42:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#smb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","description":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#bancopan","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"bancopan","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:06:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-08T04:07:46+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"O Banco Pan oferece serviços financeiros voltados às classes C, D e E. A instituição vem experimentando crescimento e, para continuar entregando boas experiências aos clientes, decidiu substituir a sua infraestrutura on-premises por um ambiente de dados 100% cloud até o final de 2022. Neste vídeo, Leandro Marçal, CTO do Banco Pan, e Samir Migliani, head de dados da instituição, falam sobre a decisão de adotar uma plataforma totalmente baseada na nuvem AWS. O Banco Pan adotou, com o suporte da AWS Professional Services, soluções como AWS DMS, AWS Lambda, AWS Glue, Amazon DynamoDB e Amazon SageMaker, entre outras, e atualmente já ultrapassou a marca de 1 milhão de contratos totalmente digitais, originados no novo aplicativo.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/BancoPan_logo%402x.435f531016bf410c52da683f0e351a96d9adfffb.png","displayLocation":"Brasil","customerNameLower":"banco pan","footerInfoText":"Data de publicação","industry":"Serviços financeiros","sortDate":"2022-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/pt/solutions/case-studies/bancopan/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Banco Pan","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"História do cliente","headline":"Em ambiente AWS, Banco Pan já ultrapassa 1 milhão de contratos digitais"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#kinesis","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Kinesis","description":"Amazon Kinesis","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:45+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","description":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#redshift","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Redshift","description":"Amazon Redshift","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#latam","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Latin America","description":"Latin America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:06+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#portuguese","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Portuguese","description":"Portuguese","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Analytics","description":"Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#brazil","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Brazil","description":"Brazil","dateCreated":"2020-04-20T18:05:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#emr","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EMR","description":"Amazon EMR","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:36+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#sagemaker","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon SageMaker","description":"Amazon SageMaker","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#financial-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Financial Services","description":"Financial Services","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#athena","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Athena","description":"Amazon Athena","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#vtex","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"vtex","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:05:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-08T04:07:47+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"A VTEX é uma plataforma comercial global, que trabalha com 2.500 marcas, lojas e empresas, ajudando-as a criar experiencias de e-commerce aos clientes, seja no ambiente B2C ou B2B. Para assegurar que seus clientes entreguem as melhores experiências aos usuários, incluindo ofertas personalizadas, entregas expressas e segurança de dados, a VTEX adota serviços da AWS. Neste vídeo, Amit Shah, diretor de estratégia (CSO) da VTEX, explica os motivos que levaram a empresa à escolha da AWS. Ele detalha a importância de se contar com um provedor com presença global, entre outras características dos serviços AWS. Confira.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/industry/automotive/logos/VTEX.8914cab096469018f9a5cb17157180fe7182d9c5.jpg","displayLocation":"Brasil","customerNameLower":"vtex","footerInfoText":"Data de publicação","industry":"Software e Internet","sortDate":"2022-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/pt/solutions/case-studies/VTEX/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"VTEX","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"História do cliente","headline":"VTEX leva serviços de nível global a clientes em todo o mundo com AWS"