9+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"CarBoat Media est le leader français des contenus auto, moto et bateau, et propose à la fois des articles (tests, actualités, guides…) et des petites annonces. L’entreprise édite cinq sites : La Centrale, Promoneuve, MavoitureCash, Les Annonces du Bateau et Caradisiac. Créée il y a plus de 40 ans, elle est passée du papier à un business model 100 % digital en 2009 afin de poursuivre son développement.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/carboat-media-logo%401x.2033c19ac1d95e1ccf7c9d0edcadcd2d0b05ff1c.jpg","displayLocation":"France","customerNameLower":"carboat media","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2019-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/fr/solutions/case-studies/carboat-media/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"CarBoat Media","publishedDate":"2019","enableShare":"1","headline":"CarBoat Media : un business model 100 % digital","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#athena","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Athena","description":"Amazon Athena","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#europe","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe","description":"Europe","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#elasticsearch","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"[DO NOT USE] Amazon Elasticsearch Service (ES)","description":"[DO NOT USE] Amazon Elasticsearch Service (ES)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:05+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-08-22T20:28:24+0000"},{"id":"GL