ive tourism companies. Launched in 1961, the company has branch offices in Taiwan, China, Japan, and the United States. In 2013, SETTour launched its website for customers to review travel destinations and make online travel bookings. Over the last five years, the website has become an increasingly important sales channel for SETTour, generating TWD$30 billion (US$974 million) in annual revenue.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Travel \u0026 Hospitality","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/settour/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"SETTour","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"AWS Case Study - SETTour"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#cost-mgmt","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Cost Optimization","description":"\u003cp\u003eCost Optimization\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-13T00:08:24+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Hospitality","description":"Hospitality","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:05+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#migration-transfer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Migration \u0026 Transfer","description":"Migration \u0026 Transfer","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#taiwan","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Taiwan","description":"Taiwan","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:38+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#business-category#cloud-cost-mgmt","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#business-category","name":"Cloud Financial Management","description":"Cloud Financial Management","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T07:06:41+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:02+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#apac","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Asia Pacific","description":"Asia Pacific","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:35+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Analytics","description":"Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#s3","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","description":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#china","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"China","description":"China","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:38+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#travel","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Travel","description":"Travel","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#mid-market","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Mid-Market","description":"Mid-Market","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#athena","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Athena","description":"Amazon Athena","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#migration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Migration","description":"Migration","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#big-data-analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","description":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:36+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#kinesis","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Kinesis","description":"Amazon Kinesis","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:45+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#travel-and-hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"travel-and-hospitality","description":"\u003cp\u003eAs of 4/2023, this tag is initially being used specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#smb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","description":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#mercado-libre-ec2-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"mercado-libre-ec2-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T14:57:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-19T03:04:48+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Mercado Libre is an e-commerce retailer based in Latin America. The company uses several AWS products including Amazon S3, Amazon EMR, Amazon Redshift for big data, and AWS Lambda, which, along with Amazon Kinesis, enables the development of real-time solutions quickly and easily.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Mercadolibre_Customer-Reference_Logo.b2f203814bb28df0f006c0ec4de2690f8d6f1119.png","displayLocation":"Latin America","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eBy incorporating Amazon EC2 Spot Instances into its hybrid architecture, Mercado Libre reduced its monthly infrastructure costs by 31 percent. Mercado Libre, an e-commerce platform in Latin America, serves more than 200 million users in 18 countries. The company shifted about 8,000 Amazon EC2 Reserved and On-Demand Instances to Spot Instances and automates provisioning decisions with an internally built application that includes Amazon Athena.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Retail","sortDate":"2018-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/mercadolibre/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Mercado Libre","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Mercado Libre Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#kinesis","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Kinesis","description":"Amazon Kinesis","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:45+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#big-data-analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","description":"Big Data \u0026 Analytics","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:36+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#s3","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","description":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#retail","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Retail","description":"Retail","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:08+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#latam","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Latin America","description":"Latin America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:06+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#emr","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EMR","description":"Amazon EMR","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:36+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#redshift","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Redshift","description":"Amazon Redshift","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Analytics","description":"Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#innovator","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Innovator","description":"Innovator","dateCreated":"2022-04-05T21:17:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-06-27T20:43:35+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#innovator#mercado-libre","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#innovator","name":"Mercado Libre","description":"Mercado Libre","dateCreated":"2022-09-15T00:48:36+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-09-15T00:48:36+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#epic-games-case-study-de","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"epic-games-case-study-de","dateCreated":"2024-09-18T20:04:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-09-18T20:08:09+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Epic Games nutzt AWS, um Fortnite mehr als 200 Millionen Spielern weltweit bereitzustellen, ein Wachstum um das 100-fache in nur zwölf Monaten zu fördern und mit Analysen eine Verbesserung des Spiels zu erreichen. Fortnite, eines der weltweit beliebtesten Videospiele, wird nahezu vollständig auf AWS ausgeführt: seine weltweite Gameserver-Flotte, Backend-Services, Datenbanken, Websites, Analyse-Pipeline- und Verarbeitungssysteme und mehr. Mit Hilfe diverser AWS-Services kann Epic Games die erforderliche Verfügbarkeit bereitstellen, um Nutzungsspitzen, die bis zu 10-mal höher als Nebenzeiten sind, zu unterstützen. Auch die nötige Skalierbarkeit, um Spieleereignisse mit allen 200 Millionen Nutzern zu hosten, kann Epic Games so gewährleisten. Chris Dyl, Director of Platform bei Epic Games, im Rahmen eines Vortrags auf der re:Invent 2018.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/EpicGames_Customer-Reference_Logo.8a439eccad8e4f56fc6f9733371dfecc459b5ba3.png","displayLocation":"Amerika","customerNameLower":"epic games","industry":"Computerspiele","sortDate":"2018-01-01","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/de/solutions/case-studies/EPICGames/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Kundengeschichte","customer-name":"Epic Games","headline":"AWS re:Invent 2018: Epic Games nutzt AWS, um Fortnite für 200 Millionen Spieler bereitzustellen"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#german","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"German","description":"German","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:24+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-24T02:42:26+0000"},{"id":"GL